      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-09-14T21:10:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My recollection, perhaps incorrect, was that the shared stuff would just be inlined into each Backend struct rather than a base class. (I mean repeating the members in each one, i.e. not having a GrShaderSurfaceInfo). Maybe I\u0027m misremembering?\n\nWhat are the Info2 structs?",
      "parentUuid": "9df79c2e_a45d36c1",
      "revId": "6923f3c343a5a264a5724a35453d1faaa6fd6f7e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cb52aa99_2d425dd1",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 5036
