      "writtenOn": "2021-09-14T21:17:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The Info2 structs were what was going to replace the current ctor inputs to GrBackendTexture and the backend getters off of GrBackendTexture. The ctors could easily take the new Gr*SurfaceInfo + backend ids + mutable state structs. However, it would be a pain to return those all individually from the getters. So figured put it all in one struct and use it for both.\n\nTBH I haven\u0027t thought too much about those structs yet or the best name for them. So definitely open to any suggestions on how to best structure those things.",
      "parentUuid": "c20085b8_ecef2fb2",
      "revId": "6923f3c343a5a264a5724a35453d1faaa6fd6f7e",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
